// Full case folding for the 104 code points whose fold is longer than one
// code point - German sharp s folds to "ss", the ligatures fold to their
// component letters, and a handful of Greek and Armenian forms expand
// similarly. These are why case-insensitive comparison cannot be done
// byte for byte or even code point for code point: the two sides can
// differ in length.
//
// The expansions are code points rather than strings so that this
// package stays free of any string dependency - std/str imports
// std/unicode, so the arrow cannot point back. _FOLDF_CP is the sorted
// key column; _FOLDF_OFF and _FOLDF_LEN slice the expansion out of the
// flattened _FOLDF_SEQ.
