// Compatibility decomposition: 5913 code points expanding to 9192 in total, at
// most 18 each.
//
// These add the mappings NFKD and NFKC use on top of the canonical
// ones. For Arabic and Persian this is the table that matters most:
// the presentation forms in U+FB50..U+FDFF and U+FE70..U+FEFF - the
// isolated, initial, medial and final shapes that some sources store
// literally instead of letting the renderer choose - decompose back to
// the plain letters here, and nowhere else.
